# sdist: the whole test suite (conftest.py and fixtures included, so packagers can run it) and the changelog.
# README/PYPI.md, LICENSE and NOTICE come from [project] (readme, license-files); src/ comes from setuptools.
# Build from a clean checkout (git archive): `graft` takes whatever sits under tests/, bytecode caches included.
graft tests
include CHANGELOG.md
